    "pages": [
        {
            "id": "greeting",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "Enough for now. I brought you here for a reason."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page2');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "The first issue is the identity of the Trainer called Essentia."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "In truth, she is simply a young girl called Emma,"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "wearing a piece of special technology dubbed the Expansion Suit."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "The Expansion Suit was created by Dr. Xerosic."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "I can see that name means something to you. You remember him, I take it."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "...One of Team Flare's scientists."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "This brings me to my request, young trainer. Make sure Xerosic disappears."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "I don't care how. If you need a reason, call it honor among thieves..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "Even we in Team Flare had our sense of pride."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "You may have disagreed with us, but we were doing what we thought right."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "I won't let him sully our honor now."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "The hero of Kalos would hardly wish for that girl Emma to keep staining her hands with these crimes as Essentia."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "If you want to help the girl, you need to put a stop to Xerosic. And that I can help you with!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "If we leave now, we should find him at Lysandre Caf\u00e9."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "Don't dawdle. Be ready to face death if you go."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "malva",
            "lines": [
                "Prepare well if you want a shot at surviving."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Close",
                        "value": "close",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud -491 144 316 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.run_command('tp @e[x=-491,y=143,z=316,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] 10000000 -50000 -10000000');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' add Dialogue196');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' remove InDialogue');",
                            "q.dialogue.close();"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}